1
00:00:00,478 --> 00:00:03,652
Reach your hands out,

2
00:00:03,652 --> 00:00:06,913
cut through the wind,

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:12,130
and forge ahead, drawing your own map as you go!

4
00:00:16,435 --> 00:00:19,565
We can't even tell left from right

5
00:00:19,608 --> 00:00:22,782
in this tempest-tossed era

6
00:00:22,869 --> 00:00:26,043
Even the values we've honed

7
00:00:26,043 --> 00:00:29,390
seem ready to crumble

8
00:00:29,391 --> 00:00:32,652
Is the compass leading us true,

9
00:00:32,696 --> 00:00:35,869
or is it leading us astray?

10
00:00:35,869 --> 00:00:39,217
Nobody knows for sure!

11
00:00:39,217 --> 00:00:45,652
Just breathe deep, close your eyes

12
00:00:45,739 --> 00:00:52,696
and you'll find your soul guiding the way!

13
00:00:52,739 --> 00:00:55,913
Reach your hands out,

14
00:00:55,913 --> 00:00:59,174
cut through the wind,

15
00:00:59,174 --> 00:01:04,043
and kick away the darkness!

16
00:01:05,086 --> 00:01:08,129
I'm doing this for myself,

17
00:01:08,130 --> 00:01:12,260
and you're doing this for yourself too, right?

18
00:01:12,347 --> 00:01:17,347
Forge ahead, painting the world in your own colors!

19
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:33,608
I am a brawler by trade.

20
00:01:33,608 --> 00:01:34,782
I show mercy to none...

21
00:01:35,826 --> 00:01:37,304
...not even women!

22
00:01:52,130 --> 00:01:54,043
Oiran...

23
00:01:54,043 --> 00:01:55,129
...Knuckles!

24
00:02:03,086 --> 00:02:05,521
Ah, how satisfying to strike you!

25
00:02:08,739 --> 00:02:10,913
It must be because you're so big!

26
00:02:23,347 --> 00:02:25,956
My, now...
Running out on me, are we?

27
00:02:30,174 --> 00:02:31,913
Maricade!

28
00:02:38,782 --> 00:02:41,434
The webs that barred your way...

29
00:02:42,174 --> 00:02:44,434
...are flammable!

30
00:02:44,478 --> 00:02:46,217
Mariarson!

31
00:02:54,260 --> 00:02:57,695
"Over before it even began,"
you say?

32
00:02:59,521 --> 00:03:05,260
In you came, like a knight in shining armor,
to cover for the shameful Black-Leg Sanji's disgrace,

33
00:03:05,347 --> 00:03:09,217
but should you be
handily defeated here,

34
00:03:09,217 --> 00:03:13,130
you will make a fool of yourself,
just as he did!

35
00:03:15,696 --> 00:03:19,261
Bloom in this sea of flames,
if you dare!

36
00:03:21,826 --> 00:03:25,652
Can flowers bloom
within flame?!

37
00:03:27,652 --> 00:03:28,609
Oh, no!

38
00:03:36,217 --> 00:03:39,304
She's the Demon Child!
We can't let her live!

39
00:03:39,304 --> 00:03:41,825
Your crime? Existing!

40
00:03:43,347 --> 00:03:45,521
As I told you before,

41
00:03:45,521 --> 00:03:49,478
you're a burden to
your crewmates!

42
00:03:51,521 --> 00:03:53,912
A tramp like you...

43
00:03:53,913 --> 00:03:57,435
...is sought after by
the great movers of the world...

44
00:03:57,435 --> 00:04:01,304
...only for that
Poneglyph-deciphering brain you possess!

45
00:04:02,652 --> 00:04:05,522
Who needs your personality?
They just need you alive!

46
00:04:05,608 --> 00:04:07,956
Nothing but means to an end!

47
00:04:07,957 --> 00:04:11,261
You need neither
your arms, nor your legs!

48
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:14,783
Punching such
an irritating tramp...

49
00:04:14,957 --> 00:04:17,652
...feels sooo good!

50
00:04:22,782 --> 00:04:27,608
See, now? Your vulgar rampage
caused this raging inferno to spread!

51
00:04:27,608 --> 00:04:29,304
What are you going to
do about it?

52
00:04:29,826 --> 00:04:32,869
Going to ask that skeleton monster
to put it out again?

53
00:04:32,869 --> 00:04:37,652
Go on, ask him to clean up
the mess you made!

54
00:04:38,043 --> 00:04:42,651
I overheard you utter some
ridiculous things yourself, Black Maria-san.

55
00:04:42,652 --> 00:04:44,652
Were I you...

56
00:04:45,608 --> 00:04:47,695
I would flee from
where you stand!

57
00:04:50,478 --> 00:04:51,565
Robin-san!

58
00:04:52,130 --> 00:04:53,565
Robin-san!

59
00:04:54,608 --> 00:04:55,999
Hey, you listening?

60
00:04:56,521 --> 00:04:57,565
I've been telling you...

61
00:04:58,478 --> 00:05:01,565
...you've gotta know how
to throw a punch, just in case!

62
00:05:02,565 --> 00:05:04,608
Is slapping
out of the question, Koala?

63
00:05:04,608 --> 00:05:07,130
The people after you
want you dead, though!

64
00:05:07,217 --> 00:05:08,565
Slapping won't cut it!

65
00:05:10,739 --> 00:05:14,043
How about using the heel of your palm,
this part of it?

66
00:05:14,608 --> 00:05:16,391
Speed matters more than power!

67
00:05:16,478 --> 00:05:19,260
Throw with speed,
pull back with speed!

68
00:05:19,260 --> 00:05:20,347
And be like, wham!

69
00:05:21,826 --> 00:05:22,652
Huh?

70
00:05:25,435 --> 00:05:28,521
Robin, want me to teach you
Dragon Claw Fist?

71
00:05:29,260 --> 00:05:31,173
Would be a great
addition to your arsenal!

72
00:05:31,782 --> 00:05:36,260
What're you doing here, Sabo-kun?!
I'm the one teaching her!

73
00:05:36,260 --> 00:05:38,564
Doesn't matter
who teaches her, does it?

74
00:05:38,565 --> 00:05:39,825
Then I will!

75
00:05:39,826 --> 00:05:41,260
No, I'm gonna!

76
00:05:41,260 --> 00:05:46,304
I'm more suited for it than you!
I'm a Fishman Karate assistant instructor!

77
00:05:46,304 --> 00:05:49,564
Hey now, hey now... No need for
the both of you to impose!

78
00:05:49,565 --> 00:05:50,956
Oh, Hack!

79
00:05:50,957 --> 00:05:53,478
Robin's strong enough
with her locking techniques.

80
00:05:53,478 --> 00:05:57,260
But once we've gone our separate ways,
we can't protect her!

81
00:05:57,260 --> 00:05:59,695
I told you she's strong, didn't I?

82
00:06:00,869 --> 00:06:04,652
But with Fishman Karate,
Robin-san can really put her skills to good use!

83
00:06:04,652 --> 00:06:07,913
Dragon Claw Fist's
better suited for that!

84
00:06:07,913 --> 00:06:10,260
Robin has her own way of fighting!

85
00:06:10,260 --> 00:06:13,477
Palms can be used
without special abilities like yours!

86
00:06:13,478 --> 00:06:16,521
Dragon Claw Fist is great for practical stuff,
I'm telling you!

87
00:06:16,521 --> 00:06:17,956
Palms!

88
00:06:18,739 --> 00:06:21,478
Neither of you
are listening to me!

89
00:06:22,304 --> 00:06:26,260
Robin!
I still ain't heard it straight from you!

90
00:06:26,347 --> 00:06:29,695
Tell me you wanna live!

91
00:06:31,739 --> 00:06:37,174
Help me, Robin-chan!

92
00:06:40,086 --> 00:06:43,347
Never did I think that I would
want to become stronger...

93
00:06:43,347 --> 00:06:45,782
ooofor the sake of another.

94
00:06:46,260 --> 00:06:51,521
You'll be just fine
if you leave it to me!

95
00:06:51,521 --> 00:06:52,043
Then...

96
00:06:52,043 --> 00:06:53,086
Huh?

97
00:06:53,782 --> 00:06:57,782
Mind teaching me a little
about that "palm" thing?

98
00:07:00,608 --> 00:07:01,565
Okay!

99
00:07:02,565 --> 00:07:05,086
Are you sure about
teaching me this, though?

100
00:07:05,086 --> 00:07:07,477
Of course we are!

101
00:07:07,478 --> 00:07:10,782
You're important to us,
Robin-san!

102
00:07:15,260 --> 00:07:16,304
Robin-san!

103
00:07:17,565 --> 00:07:18,173
This is...

104
00:07:19,130 --> 00:07:20,347
...the ace up your sleeve!

105
00:07:20,826 --> 00:07:22,782
It uses your palms as well...

106
00:07:22,869 --> 00:07:25,043
...but it's a secret art of
Fishman Karate!

107
00:07:33,957 --> 00:07:35,217
Mil Fleurs,

108
00:07:37,086 --> 00:07:38,129
Fishman Karate:

109
00:07:49,086 --> 00:07:50,347
Giganteum!

110
00:08:01,217 --> 00:08:02,826
Where were you aiming?

111
00:08:04,435 --> 00:08:05,174
Certainly...

112
00:08:06,913 --> 00:08:10,826
Certainly, my palms came in handy
countless times.

113
00:08:13,608 --> 00:08:16,565
Sense your opponent's core!

114
00:08:17,435 --> 00:08:20,261
Sense my opponent's core!

115
00:08:36,869 --> 00:08:40,260
Drat!
The flames are gone?!

116
00:09:00,913 --> 00:09:02,913
What...?
That form...!

117
00:09:16,086 --> 00:09:17,695
A demon!

118
00:09:25,347 --> 00:09:26,912
Unhand me!

119
00:09:36,043 --> 00:09:40,347
There are people
who truly need me,

120
00:09:40,869 --> 00:09:43,086
and rely on me!

121
00:09:43,826 --> 00:09:47,043
And for them,
I would go so far as to...

122
00:09:50,869 --> 00:09:52,826
...become demon incarnate!

123
00:10:06,739 --> 00:10:09,608
Gran Jacuzzi...

124
00:10:09,608 --> 00:10:10,869
...Clutch!

125
00:10:13,217 --> 00:10:17,086
Black Maria-sama is
at peak performance today!

126
00:10:17,086 --> 00:10:19,303
That tramp is finished!

127
00:10:26,739 --> 00:10:29,522
S...top...!

128
00:10:31,391 --> 00:10:34,130
"Need neither arms nor legs"?

129
00:10:35,913 --> 00:10:39,043
No! Not mine...!

130
00:10:39,043 --> 00:10:40,912
I was talking about yours!

131
00:10:59,043 --> 00:11:01,086
What... was that noise?!

132
00:11:01,086 --> 00:11:02,477
Black Maria-sama!

133
00:11:02,478 --> 00:11:04,521
The ice is in the way!

134
00:11:04,521 --> 00:11:06,782
Damn that skeleton monster!

135
00:11:10,260 --> 00:11:13,477
Black Maria... sama?

136
00:11:18,652 --> 00:11:22,087
Black Maria-sama was...!

137
00:11:23,043 --> 00:11:24,912
It's a demon!

138
00:11:33,608 --> 00:11:37,608
Much obliged to you all
for lining up!

139
00:11:38,826 --> 00:11:41,478
And now...
Phrase d'Armes:

140
00:11:41,478 --> 00:11:43,261
Orchestra!

141
00:12:03,739 --> 00:12:05,130
Welcome home...

142
00:12:05,782 --> 00:12:06,782
Robin-san.

143
00:12:07,260 --> 00:12:08,782
Glad to be home.

144
00:12:08,782 --> 00:12:10,304
Thank you...

145
00:12:11,130 --> 00:12:12,174
...for waiting

146
00:12:13,304 --> 00:12:15,912
I'm a little... exhausted.

147
00:12:16,478 --> 00:12:17,521
Whoa, there.

148
00:12:20,260 --> 00:12:21,260
Robin-san...

149
00:12:27,174 --> 00:12:30,130
You all actually get it, right?!

150
00:12:30,174 --> 00:12:33,260
That's a month's worth of my food!

151
00:12:34,086 --> 00:12:38,434
You'd better return the favor,
or there's gonna be problems!

152
00:12:39,260 --> 00:12:41,956
Anyway, I can't believe
you had this much food on you!

153
00:12:41,957 --> 00:12:46,217
My Swamp-Swamp Fruit power
is bottomless!

154
00:12:47,130 --> 00:12:48,304
Straw Hat!

155
00:12:48,304 --> 00:12:50,651
What's happened to our captain,
Bepo, and the rest?!

156
00:12:52,696 --> 00:12:53,565
73!!

157
00:12:54,304 --> 00:12:55,434
Iw aaiu"?

158
00:12:55,435 --> 00:12:59,521
I am begging you!
Only you, Shinobu, are capable of this!

159
00:12:59,521 --> 00:13:03,260
Indeed I am capable,
but why do you wish this?!

160
00:13:03,260 --> 00:13:05,521
I would grant
Luffy his wish!

161
00:13:06,086 --> 00:13:07,564
His wish?

162
00:13:08,391 --> 00:13:12,086
I must take Luffy there!

163
00:13:12,086 --> 00:13:15,173
That is why I wish to go
to Onigashima once again!

164
00:13:15,696 --> 00:13:16,739
What?!

165
00:13:18,652 --> 00:13:21,869
Why... do you speak
such ridiculousness?!

166
00:13:21,869 --> 00:13:27,391
could never again let you
set foot upon such a dangerous place!

167
00:13:27,391 --> 00:13:28,608
Wait, Shinobu!

168
00:13:28,608 --> 00:13:33,869
If nothing is done, the Flower Capital
and the Land of Wano will be annihilated!

169
00:13:33,869 --> 00:13:38,217
It is for that reason I must go,
no matter the cost!

170
00:13:38,217 --> 00:13:39,608
I beg of you!
You must, for our sakes-

171
00:13:39,608 --> 00:13:44,478
Momonosuke-sama,
listen to me very carefully.

172
00:13:44,478 --> 00:13:47,739
If I do this,
you will never...

173
00:13:47,739 --> 00:13:51,000
be able to return
to your current appearance!

174
00:13:52,304 --> 00:13:56,130
That is to say,
your mind will remain that of a child...

175
00:13:56,130 --> 00:13:59,391
...and only your body will mature!

176
00:13:59,391 --> 00:14:00,652
If you follow through-

177
00:14:00,652 --> 00:14:01,696
I care not!

178
00:14:02,347 --> 00:14:05,217
I might be able to become...

179
00:14:05,217 --> 00:14:07,608
...a bigger dragon that way!

180
00:14:11,913 --> 00:14:13,130
And yet...

181
00:14:13,217 --> 00:14:15,434
I cannot bring myself
to do such a thing...

182
00:14:16,086 --> 00:14:17,173
Momonosuke-sama!

183
00:14:17,782 --> 00:14:19,304
I am begging you!

184
00:14:19,347 --> 00:14:22,086
Y-You mustn't do that,
Momonosuke-sama!

185
00:14:22,086 --> 00:14:24,216
Please, Shinobu!

186
00:14:24,826 --> 00:14:27,347
Use your Ripe-Ripe Jutsu...

187
00:14:29,130 --> 00:14:31,652
to make me an adult...

188
00:14:31,652 --> 00:14:37,043
Please...
make me an adult...

189
00:14:37,086 --> 00:14:40,216
Make me an adult!

190
00:14:43,086 --> 00:14:46,260
The Animal Kingdom Pirates,
numbering 30,000, versus...

191
00:14:46,260 --> 00:14:50,869
the 5,400-strong
Samurai-Pirate Alliance raiders!

192
00:14:50,869 --> 00:14:52,739
The gap in manpower quickly shrank...

193
00:14:52,739 --> 00:14:55,217
...thanks to
O-Tama's Kibi Dango strategy,

194
00:14:55,217 --> 00:14:59,739
...and the valiant fighting by
samurai and pirate alike.

195
00:14:59,739 --> 00:15:03,261
The resolute, top-ranking enemy officers,
the Flying Six, are wiped out!

196
00:15:05,739 --> 00:15:08,869
Onigashima, far above
the Wano mainland,

197
00:15:09,304 --> 00:15:13,390
...will soon arrive
upon the Flower Capital!

198
00:15:21,347 --> 00:15:26,477
Why did you serve Kurozumi Orochi,
that hideous man...

199
00:15:26,478 --> 00:15:28,000
Fukurokuju?!

200
00:15:28,696 --> 00:15:32,956
We ninja serve the reigning Shogun
to the bitter end.

201
00:15:34,782 --> 00:15:37,478
Ninja Art: Clone Technique!

202
00:15:43,608 --> 00:15:46,043
Such insolence!

203
00:15:50,435 --> 00:15:53,739
What about the man you serve?!

204
00:15:53,739 --> 00:15:55,869
A ghost, is he not?!

205
00:15:57,086 --> 00:15:59,216
You speak of Oden-sama?!

206
00:15:59,217 --> 00:16:00,913
The real one is there!

207
00:16:08,652 --> 00:16:12,174
An emotionally-laden man like you...

208
00:16:12,174 --> 00:16:15,043
...is completely incapable
of being a ninja!

209
00:16:15,608 --> 00:16:18,782
No matter how adept you
are with ninja techniques!

210
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:27,870
It is thanks to our emotions...
that we are sated!

211
00:16:28,782 --> 00:16:31,391
That day, we...

212
00:16:31,869 --> 00:16:35,565
...cried together,
laughed together.

213
00:16:36,260 --> 00:16:40,130
And together,
we died with Oden-sama!

214
00:16:40,739 --> 00:16:46,000
We are but apparitions,
seeking to execute our lord's will!

215
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:49,000
You will not sully that
by calling it a mere "duty"!

216
00:16:49,000 --> 00:16:53,913
It is because we servants
bear these emotions...

217
00:16:53,913 --> 00:16:56,086
...that we have no qualms
if we should die in battle!

218
00:16:56,086 --> 00:17:00,303
Today, the night called
Orochi-Kaido shall end,

219
00:17:00,304 --> 00:17:04,043
and the brilliant sun
will rise in its place...

220
00:17:04,043 --> 00:17:08,477
...with Momonosuke-sama
as Shogun!

221
00:17:12,608 --> 00:17:13,869
Hawkins!

222
00:17:13,869 --> 00:17:18,130
Just how many damn substitutes
do you have?!

223
00:17:18,130 --> 00:17:21,739
I've only a handful left...
Ah, this doesn't look good for me...

224
00:17:23,869 --> 00:17:25,565
I mourn those lives.

225
00:17:38,086 --> 00:17:40,564
Bring it on, punk!

226
00:18:01,260 --> 00:18:02,999
Only a few remain...

227
00:18:03,435 --> 00:18:05,304
...however,
what truly matters is...

228
00:18:06,782 --> 00:18:08,652
...whose lives are in them, yes?

229
00:18:08,652 --> 00:18:09,826
Huh?!

230
00:18:09,869 --> 00:18:12,695
The hell's with this
stab wound from outta nowhere?!

231
00:18:13,782 --> 00:18:15,695
Hey, what's with you
all of a sudden?!

232
00:18:22,739 --> 00:18:25,696
Don't tell me that straw doll...!

233
00:18:26,174 --> 00:18:28,434
Now you notice...

234
00:18:29,565 --> 00:18:36,260
It would have been entertaining to observe you
kill Kid without realizing that it's him...

235
00:18:36,782 --> 00:18:41,173
...but watching you
grow helpless...

236
00:18:41,174 --> 00:18:43,434
...is just as interesting,
wouldn't you say?

237
00:18:45,086 --> 00:18:48,521
You can kill me...

238
00:18:48,565 --> 00:18:52,260
...only after killing your own captain!

239
00:18:52,260 --> 00:18:53,738
You damned, lousy...!

240
00:19:03,391 --> 00:19:04,913
Oh, how delightful it is...

241
00:19:05,652 --> 00:19:10,522
...to imagine you suffering
under that mask.

242
00:19:12,478 --> 00:19:16,478
Go on, then...
Do your worst! I won't stop you!

243
00:19:23,217 --> 00:19:25,130
You are one messed up guy,
ya know that?

244
00:19:27,869 --> 00:19:29,912
Outta my way, Trafalgar!

245
00:19:46,826 --> 00:19:49,999
The price of betrayal is high!

246
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:57,086
Hey there,
ex-Animal Kingdom Pirate garbage!

247
00:19:57,086 --> 00:20:01,521
I'm sentencing
all o' ya to die in a fire!

248
00:20:10,869 --> 00:20:13,434
Where's Marco-san?!
Do something, anything, please!

249
00:20:16,913 --> 00:20:19,826
He's reached his physical limits!

250
00:20:21,391 --> 00:20:23,695
It's up to us to do something!

251
00:20:31,957 --> 00:20:32,957
Sangoro-san!

252
00:20:33,260 --> 00:20:34,521
Are you okay?!

253
00:20:35,260 --> 00:20:38,521
Dammit...
two at once is freakin' rough!

254
00:20:38,521 --> 00:20:41,304
They're looking for Zorojuro!

255
00:20:42,869 --> 00:20:45,434
What the hell's
Mossbrain doing?!

256
00:20:50,130 --> 00:20:53,217
Does he need more time?

257
00:20:53,217 --> 00:20:55,652
He was in critical condition
in the first place...

258
00:20:55,652 --> 00:20:57,348
Chopper, Miyagi!

259
00:20:57,739 --> 00:21:01,739
If the drug ain't working,
take that green mummy and get outta here!

260
00:21:01,739 --> 00:21:04,782
Sanji...
We've already administered the shot!

261
00:21:06,565 --> 00:21:08,825
Hang in there, Zoro!

262
00:21:08,826 --> 00:21:11,217
Who can stop them?!

263
00:21:11,217 --> 00:21:14,739
If nothing is done,
everyone on this floor is dead!

264
00:21:15,260 --> 00:21:17,608
Find Roronoa Zoro...

265
00:21:17,608 --> 00:21:18,999
...and choke the life out of him!

266
00:21:19,565 --> 00:21:22,217
Seems they gave him
some strange treatment.

267
00:21:22,217 --> 00:21:24,043
Don't let him recover!

268
00:21:24,043 --> 00:21:25,564
Aye!

269
00:21:34,826 --> 00:21:36,826
I'm right here!

270
00:21:39,739 --> 00:21:42,478
Sangoro-san!

271
00:21:45,217 --> 00:21:46,956
You little...!

272
00:21:48,869 --> 00:21:51,826
I ain't letting you morons
do whatever you want!

273
00:21:56,391 --> 00:21:59,608
Damned monsters...

274
00:22:02,521 --> 00:22:05,391
The dust is so thick,
I can barely see!

275
00:22:05,608 --> 00:22:10,217
I'm going to
remove Vinsmoke Sanji!

276
00:22:10,217 --> 00:22:11,695
Mlem!

277
00:22:11,696 --> 00:22:15,304
If you had married Pudding...

278
00:22:15,304 --> 00:22:18,651
we wouldn't be stuck working
with those idiots!

279
00:22:25,782 --> 00:22:27,956
It's him, Master!

280
00:22:28,478 --> 00:22:30,043
I see...

281
00:22:31,521 --> 00:22:32,956
Mlem!

282
00:22:33,608 --> 00:22:37,434
Chew on this,
you Germa defect!

283
00:22:39,913 --> 00:22:44,826
Come on ouuuut!

284
00:22:48,521 --> 00:22:51,565
This un's for Pedro!

285
00:23:02,869 --> 00:23:05,130
Ain't done with ye yet!

286
00:23:05,217 --> 00:23:07,782
I found Roronoa Zoro!

287
00:23:08,260 --> 00:23:09,825
Make him dead!

288
00:23:09,826 --> 00:23:12,826
Aye!

289
00:23:13,435 --> 00:23:14,956
They found us!

290
00:23:16,347 --> 00:23:19,695
Protect Zorojuro!
He suffered these wounds honorably!

291
00:23:19,696 --> 00:23:21,174
Aye!

292
00:23:21,217 --> 00:23:25,913
They're all wounded!
Finish them off along with Roronoa!

293
00:23:26,652 --> 00:23:30,565
Keep up with them!
Stay strong, Miyagi, Tristan!

294
00:23:30,565 --> 00:23:31,260
Okay!

295
00:23:59,391 --> 00:24:01,695
King's here!

296
00:24:19,652 --> 00:24:21,478
Don't do it, sonny!

297
00:24:25,174 --> 00:24:27,652
Dammit! Do I gotta do
everything for ya, Mossbrain?!

298
00:24:33,826 --> 00:24:36,695
You ain't gettin' in our way,
Black Leg!

299
00:24:46,608 --> 00:24:47,565
You're done!

300
00:24:49,260 --> 00:24:51,260
Imperial Flame!

301
00:24:51,347 --> 00:24:52,521
Undying Thistle!

302
00:25:04,696 --> 00:25:06,696
I once heard...

303
00:25:06,696 --> 00:25:11,826
A long, long time ago,
upon the red wall...

304
00:25:11,826 --> 00:25:15,521
...dwelled a race of people
capable of igniting themselves.

305
00:25:15,957 --> 00:25:19,087
King the Wildfire, huh?

306
00:25:21,174 --> 00:25:23,782
How the hell're you still kickin'...

307
00:25:23,782 --> 00:25:25,782
Marco?!

308
00:25:25,869 --> 00:25:27,434
Go to hell already...

309
00:25:27,913 --> 00:25:29,869
Whitebeard Pirates!

310
00:25:29,869 --> 00:25:31,956
Sure...

311
00:25:31,957 --> 00:25:33,261
I give!

312
00:25:35,957 --> 00:25:39,957
I've gotten all I want outta this.
This is as far as I take things.

313
00:25:54,391 --> 00:25:57,130
And now...
The real stars of this show, oh yeah.

314
00:26:19,869 --> 00:26:22,434
Roronoa!

315
00:26:28,608 --> 00:26:29,695
Diable...

316
00:26:30,696 --> 00:26:32,782
Three-Sword Style:

317
00:26:33,869 --> 00:26:35,652
Purgatory...

318
00:26:42,869 --> 00:26:45,304
Mouton Mallet!

319
00:27:10,739 --> 00:27:13,696
Way to go, Straw Hats!

320
00:27:13,696 --> 00:27:18,609
It really did
heal his wounds!

321
00:27:19,608 --> 00:27:22,347
Still...
I fear what comes after...

322
00:27:23,739 --> 00:27:25,565
Hey, Swirly Brow.

323
00:27:26,696 --> 00:27:29,782
Once we've won this fight...

324
00:27:30,478 --> 00:27:33,130
Yeah, we're gonna get to see a little bit...

325
00:27:34,217 --> 00:27:35,434
...Of Luffy...

326
00:27:36,304 --> 00:27:38,999
...becoming the Pirate King!